      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is very important that you do not increase your ibuprofen dosage without consulting a healthcare professional. Taking too much NSAIDs can cause serious gastrointestinal issues and kidney problems. Since the pain is intensifying and the redness persists, this is a sign that you need a proper evaluation, not just more over-the-counter medication. Please consider seeing a doctor to rule out more serious issues, like a blood clot.",
      "source": "target",
